# Binary golden fixtures. Without these, CRLF conversion silently corrupts a
# committed test file and the failure surfaces as an unrelated parse error.
*.avro    binary
*.parquet binary

# The committed pyiceberg warehouse (G2FEAT-125) is a golden artefact end to
# end: its metadata.json files are byte-for-byte what the writer emitted and
# must stay that way, so they are not eligible for line-ending normalisation
# either — even though pyiceberg happens to emit them with no newlines at all.
tests/data/golden_iceberg_table/** binary
